Phase: Project Import/Export Full Fidelity Feature
Status: Verified & Completed
Date: 2026-10-29
App: Content Strategy Hub
Author: vlad@bluebeeweb.com

Summary of Changes:
- schemas.py:
  * Added ExportProjectParams, ExportProjectResult
  * Added ImportProjectParams, ImportProjectResult
- main.py:
  * Backend action export_project: extracts site_profile and all 14 related store collections:
    - opportunities
    - article_briefs
    - queue_items
    - site_competitors
    - content_audits
    - cannibalization_findings
    - existing_content_items
    - content_authors
    - content_decay_readings
    - content_decay_reports
    - kpi_snapshots
    - kpi_dashboards
    - outreach_targets
    - ile_status_cache
  * Backend action import_project: restores project and all collections with direct overwrite or ID remapping
  * UI in _project_tabs_view: Added "Export" and "Import" buttons in the project header row with modal dialogs
- tests/test_smoke.py:
  * Comprehensive roundtrip test test_export_and_import_project_roundtrip verifying complete export/import fidelity across all collections.
- backup/:
  * Created pre-modification backups of main.py, schemas.py, and imperal.json.
